<https://n2t.net/ark:/27023/237e1bf61c0976d8e972a69a3cb30f8a> <https://colonialcollections.nl/schema#description> "Tekening in potlood. Portret van W.H. Willemsen-van Ruler. Kamptekening? Ongesigneerd.\r\nVan gedicht voorzien:\r\n\"And in the dusty tavern of my soul\r\nWhere filthy lusts drink witches brew for wine.\r\nHer gentle hand still keeps me from that bowl\r\nStill keeps" .
<https://n2t.net/ark:/27023/237e1bf61c0976d8e972a69a3cb30f8a> <https://colonialcollections.nl/schema#inscription> "And in the dusty tavern of my soul\r\nWhere filthy lusts drink witches brew for wine.\r\nHer gentle hand still keeps me from that bowl\r\nStill keeps me man, saves me drom being swine." .
